     1,
     "<font size=\"3\">Hi,</font><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"3\">I would like to alter the TMB code in <a href=\"https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/laplace_8cpp-example.html\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/laplace_8cpp-example.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461661613000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cd3q9jbC8IKoCvF4O3lUM\">https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/laplace_8cpp-example.html</a></font></div><div><font size=\"3\">I need to find a solution to a problem using a speial kind of eigen matrices. </font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><br></font></div><div><font size=\"3\">So: then I need to find a matrix where I evalulate the current matrix at the input parameters fixed. The current matrix is made through calling <a href=\"https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/structmatrix.html\" style=\"font-family:monospace,fixed;color:rgb(70,101,162)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/structmatrix.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461661613000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zcDksxlvxT5pRV2WdiJU2\">matrix&lt;Type&gt;</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace,fixed\"> H = </span><a style=\"font-family:monospace,fixed;color:rgb(61,87,140)\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><a href=\"https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/namespaceautodiff.html#aece87159d1d7bc9099eff6b751143db4\" style=\"font-family:monospace,fixed;color:rgb(70,101,162)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/namespaceautodiff.html%23aece87159d1d7bc9099eff6b751143db4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461661613000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3IrBRvprOBwqVaAGUNa3hc\">autodiff::hessian</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace,fixed\">(f, u); so I would need to typecast that matrix to the Eigen special type. </span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace,fixed\"><br></span></font></div><div><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:monospace,fixed\">Any tips out there would be appreciated. </span></font></div><br>"
    ]
   ]
