     "<br>One partial-solution is found at <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/g/tmb-users/c/vIGs97W9O1Y/m/hPdpMrCcBQAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/g/tmb-users/c/vIGs97W9O1Y/m/hPdpMrCcBQAJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461661615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0dxoWhMZ4xvIKrDiRwqsr2\">https://groups.google.com/g/tmb-users/c/vIGs97W9O1Y/m/hPdpMrCcBQAJ</a><div><br></div><div> which says that <div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">int temp_ind = CppAD::Integer(matrix_of_doubles(x,y,z)); </font></span><div><br></div></div><div>One example to convert CppAD to eigen sparseMatrix is given at </div><div><a href=\"https://coin-or.github.io/CppAD/doc/sparse2eigen.cpp.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://coin-or.github.io/CppAD/doc/sparse2eigen.cpp.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792461661615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3TwNAmwDjki7gHEWMVW7Vo\">https://coin-or.github.io/CppAD/doc/sparse2eigen.cpp.htm</a><br></div></div>"
